  "findings": {
    "usb": [
      "The base nub accepted source0 only; AppleUSBXHCI IR1/IR2 require independently registered sources1/2. Device exposes1 slot and Host3. Software deliveries invoke the requested action with inFlight guarding, without GIC masking, observe or hard-interrupt destruction.",
      "The bridge routes active1/2 independently, counts only actual deliveries and preserves ERDP progress/idle reset and1000 consecutive-no-progress/50ms backoff. Physical source0 semantics and427-slot XHCI ABI are retained."
    ],
    "wifi": [
      "Successful Skywalk ifnet_input now increments legacy ifnet RX counters; non-Skywalk and failure paths remain unchanged.",
      "Actual pinned nw_wifi_disconnect() resets reported state to IDLE before its queued operation is consumed. A lock-protected pending query generated from the pinned nw_mainline.c prevents a new join from overwriting the pending disconnect; drain remains bounded at2000ms.",
      "Leave/join/pre-join probes are atomically bounded to32 each; link-up timestamps use acquire/release atomics and event9 remains540 bytes."
    ],
    "bluetooth": [
      "Fixed8 handle table tracks Classic/LE connection, mode, supervision timeout, all ACL counts/timestamps/CIDs and signaling PSM. Observational SCO/eSCO and role counters added.",
      "Quotas1600 total/1100 key/496 normal; signaling and SMP bypass CID limits. Disconnect summaries have their own32-entry quota and include IBS/drop context even after ordinary quota exhaustion.",
      "Successful NVM .bin loads record actual name and byte size without changing selection or firmware content. Transport/IBS/UART/power executor functions are byte-identical to the base; powerOn adds only diagnostic reset."
    ],
